      184.1,
      178.1,
      408.37,
      190.58
    ],
    "text": "WEATHER FORECAST FOR 28 October 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      195.62,
      532.61,
      293.21
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 2.00 p.m. on 27 October 2026 The Very Severe Cyclonic Storm \u201cArnab\u201d over West-central Bay of Bengal lay centered at 11.30 a.m. of today, the 27 October 2026, near Latitude 16.0\u00b0N and Longitude 84.3\u00b0E about 820 km to the north-east of Kankasanthurai. Thereafter, it is very likely to cross the Indian land through Andhra Pradesh as a very severe cyclonic storm around 11.30 a.m. on the 28th.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      303.44,
      533.96,
      339.53
    ],
    "text": "It is expected that the impact of this system on the weather conditions across the island will gradually decrease starting tomorrow.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      352.52,
      531.53,
      387.89
    ],
    "text": "Several spells of showers will occur in Western, Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      390.68,
      534.05,
      430.01
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thunder showers will occur at few places in Uva province and in Batticaloa and Ampara districts after 1.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      433.43,
      534.05,
      487.63
    ],
    "text": "Strong winds of about (40-50) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the Central hills, Northern, North-central and North-western provinces and in Trincomalee and Hambantota Districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      490.3,
      533.62,
      528.31
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
